        "en": "Attentive clinical and reception staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express deep appreciation for the friendly, compassionate veterinary surgeons, nurses, and receptionists at Moseley. Many clients highlight individual practitioners like Erica and Angharad for their thorough explanations and kind reassurance. While isolated reviews mention customer service friction or scheduling errors, overall sentiment remains overwhelmingly positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic care for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the veterinary team’s patient handling of fearful, anxious, or difficult animals, including rescued cats, akitas, and greyhounds. Pet parents note that staff never rush consultations and adapt procedures to keep pets calm. Long-time customers trust the clinic to handle sensitive animals with dignity and gentle care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective emergency and surgical outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report successful treatment outcomes across a range of cases, from routine spaying and vaccinations to life-saving emergency poison treatments and torn-claw bandaging. Several pet owners praise the prompt follow-up phone calls after procedures, noting that their recovering dogs and cats made steady, well-monitored progress at home."
      }
    }
  ],
